<p>When you assume the form of an other body you gain more control over the body:</p><ul><li> at level 1 you gain one more talent slot</li><li> at level 2 you gain one more talent slot</li><li> at level 3 you gain resistances and flat resistances</li><li> at level 4 you gain one more talent slot</li><li> at level 5 you gain all speeds (only if they are superior to yours)</li><li> at level 6+ you gain one more talent slot</li></ul><p></p>